{
  "info": {
    "name": "EWRA Risk Register API",
    "description": "Complete API test suite for the dooit.ai EWRA Risk Register module.\n\nCovers: generate, list, retrieve by ID, retrieve by entity name, update, manual override, recalculate, submit, approve, amend, export, delete, and auto-generate from a Client record.\n\nReal-data scenarios:\n- **Smith & Associates Lawyers Pty Ltd** — Lawyers/Conveyancers T2\n- **CryptoEx Australia Pty Ltd** — VASP/DCEP, high-risk corridors\n- **Metro Property Group Pty Ltd** — Real Estate Agents T2\n- **FastSend Remittance Pty Ltd** — Remittance T1, high-risk corridors\n\n## Auth\nRun **Login** first to capture the `token` variable. All other requests use Bearer `{{token}}`.\n\n## Recommended flow\n1. Login → `token` captured\n2. Create Risk Register (Smith & Associates) → `registerId` captured\n3. List / Get by ID / **Get by Entity Name** / Update / Recalculate\n4. Patch Scenario(s) → Submit → Approve\n5. Amend (creates Draft copy from Approved)\n6. Export → Delete",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",      "value": "http://localhost:6830/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token",        "value": "",        "type": "string", "description": "Populated by Login" },
    { "key": "registerId",   "value": "",        "type": "string", "description": "Populated by Create" },
    { "key": "scenarioRef",  "value": "C-002",   "type": "string" },
    { "key": "clientId",     "value": "",        "type": "string", "description": "A valid Client _id for /from-client route" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "  console.log('token captured');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Token returned', () => pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@dooit.ai\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Risk Register — Core CRUD",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create — Smith & Associates (Lawyers T2)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Has rows', () => pm.expect(body.data.rowCount).to.be.above(0));",
                  "if (body.success && body.data._id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('registerId', body.data._id);",
                  "  console.log('registerId:', body.data._id);",
                  "  console.log('Rows:', body.data.rowCount, '| Actions:', body.data.actionCount, '| Overall:', body.data.overallResidualLabel);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"name\": \"Smith & Associates Lawyers Pty Ltd\",\n    \"entity_type\": \"Lawyers/Conveyancers\",\n    \"abn\": \"12 345 678 901\",\n    \"assessDate\": \"2026-06-17\",\n    \"co_name\": \"Jane Smith\",\n    \"co_email\": \"jane.smith@smithlawyers.com.au\",\n    \"co_phone\": \"0412 345 678\",\n    \"sm_name\": \"Robert Chen\",\n    \"sm_email\": \"r.chen@smithlawyers.com.au\",\n    \"turnover_range\": \"$2M – $10M\",\n    \"is_sole_practitioner\": \"No\",\n    \"licence_types\": [\"Legal Practitioner\"],\n    \"client_types\": [\"Individuals\", \"Bodies corporate\", \"Trusts\"],\n    \"foreign_client_proportion\": \"5% – 30%\",\n    \"complex_structures\": \"Occasionally\",\n    \"pep_exposure\": \"Domestic PEPs only\",\n    \"delivery_channels\": [\"Face to face / in-person\", \"Online platform / web portal\", \"Email or correspondence\"],\n    \"non_f2f_proportion\": \"25% – 75%\",\n    \"uses_intermediaries\": \"No\",\n    \"handles_cash\": \"Occasionally\",\n    \"ds_high_value_unfinanced\": \"Yes\",\n    \"ds_high_currency\": \"No\",\n    \"ds_intl_transfers\": \"No\",\n    \"ds_anonymous_clients\": \"No\",\n    \"ds_virtual_assets\": \"No\",\n    \"ds_complex_structures\": \"Yes\",\n    \"ds_unusual_services\": \"No\",\n    \"cr_criminal_activity\": \"Occasionally\",\n    \"cr_pep\": \"Domestic PEPs\",\n    \"cr_unexplained_wealth\": \"No\",\n    \"cr_npo\": \"No\",\n    \"ch_remote_only\": \"Yes\",\n    \"ch_third_party_cdd\": \"No\",\n    \"countries_exposure\": [\"Australia only\", \"New Zealand\"],\n    \"medium_risk_country\": \"No\",\n    \"high_risk_country\": \"No\",\n    \"sanctions_screening_confirmed\": \"Confirmed and operational\"\n  },\n  \"ctrlEff\": {\n    \"cdd\": 4,\n    \"tm\":  3,\n    \"scr\": 4,\n    \"geo\": 4,\n    \"gov\": 3\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/risk-register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["risk-register"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Risk Registers",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Returns registers array', () => pm.expect(body.data.registers).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "pm.test('Pagination fields present', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.total).to.be.a('number');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.page).to.equal(1);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.pages).to.be.a('number');",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Total registers:', body.data.total);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
